{"ref":"BDB, אוּרִיאֵל","hw":"אוּרִיאֵל","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אוּרִיאֵל</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>flame of Ēl</em> or <em>my light is Ēl</em>, v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אֵל⁴\" href=\"/BDB,_אֵל⁴\", dir=\"rtl\">אֵל</a> sub <a data-ref=\"BDB, אֵל⁴\" href=\"/BDB,_אֵל⁴\", dir=\"rtl\">אלה</a>; cf. Ph. <span dir=\"rtl\">ארמלך</span> in Assyrian <em>Urumilki</em> (Sen<sup>Taylor Cylind. ii. 50</sup>, cf. COT <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:13\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.13\">2 K 18:13</a>)<strong>) </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  chief of Levit. line of Kohath, in time of David <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:9\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.9\">1 Ch 6:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 15:5\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.15.5\">15:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 15:11\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.15.11\">11</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  maternal grandfather of Abijah <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 13:2\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.13.2\">2 Ch 13:2</a>.","next":"BDB, אוּרִיָּה","prev":"BDB, אוּרִי"}